| P3 | 3 | 1 |
| P4 | 7 | 2 |

<solution>Timeline: P1 0 to 2, P2 2 to 3, P3 3 to 4, P2 4 to 7, P4 7 to 9, P1 9 to 16. Completion: P1 16, P2 7, P3 4, P4 9. Waiting: P1 16 − 0 − 9 = 7, P2 7 − 2 − 4 = 1, P3 4 − 3 − 1 = 0, P4 9 − 7 − 2 = 0. Average 8 / 4 = 2 ms.</solution>
